        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Under aerobic conditions, Tb(NO3)3·6H2O (0.22 g, 0.5 mmol) was dissolved in MeOH/CH2Cl2 (5 mL:15 mL), followed by addition of triethanolamine (0.07 mL, 1 mmol) and triethylamine (0.55 mL, 4.0 mmol). The colourless solution was stirred for 4 h; a small amount of precipitate formed. The solution was filtered and layered with diethyl ether. Colourless crystals of 2 appeared within 1–2 days.",
